      "persona_id": "N2",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 21,
      "text": "Given the new information, Blue Lake Cabin isn't accessible anymore. We should consider the other options carefully, especially Red Cliff Lodge."
    },
    {
