      "group": "P",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 35,
      "text": "I agree with the need to focus on safety. If Blue Lake Cabin isn't an option anymore, we should seriously weigh the risks of Red Cliff Lodge. We can't afford to take unnecessary chances here."
